From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] core: add Gnoblin native preferences

Apply window, compositor, keyboard, and keybinding preferences from the
Gnoblin session configuration without changing GNOME GSettings values.

---
